1
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,576
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:12,723
=Episode 27=

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:15,603
(Empress Fu Rong
takes charge of the harem)

4
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:21,280
Your Majesty.

5
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,480
How about

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,120
we go in and see her?

7
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:37,520
Father.

8
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,120
Your Majesty.

9
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,320
I hear Your Majesty is leading the army.

10
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:52,960
The battlefield is perilous.

11
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,240
Please, Your Majesty,

12
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,760
take good care of yourself,

13
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,360
and return in triumph.

14
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,080
Rise.

15
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:06,960
So you do care about me.

16
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,040
A ruler must protect his people

17
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,520
and guard his borders.

18
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,760
I won't be the foolish ruler
you called me.

19
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,440
I was ignorant before.

20
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,120
I thought emperors were heartless,

21
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,160
cold, and cruel.

22
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,160
I spoke out of turn.

23
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,520
I overstepped my place.

24
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:24,880
I was wrong.

25
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,640
Two months ago, I learned that

26
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,840
Beijie would seek a marriage alliance.

27
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,800
The ministers feigned obedience,

28
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:34,240
embezzled military funds,

29
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:35,160
to line their own pockets.

30
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,440
Yet they expected me
to give up my daughter

31
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,560
to protect their own interests.

32
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,440
It's despicable.

33
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,640
Since they wanted to deceive me,

34
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,520
I pretended to agree.

35
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:46,840
While they let their guard down,

36
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,520
I investigated everything in secret

37
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:49,600
and caught them all.

38
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,640
Your Majesty is wise.

39
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:55,600
You all say emperors are heartless.

40
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,000
I may sit upon the throne,

41
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,320
but I am utterly alone.

42
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,800
I cannot afford to hesitate,

43
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,760
nor can I let personal feelings
cloud my judgment.

44
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,400
I cannot even

45
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:12,080
have someone by my side to confide in.

46
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,040
But you...

47
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,840
Though you live in the inner palace,

48
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,960
you have a heart for the whole realm.

49
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,880
I admire that.

50
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,200
The scheming among the harem,

51
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,560
the power struggles,

52
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,840
the jealousy,

53
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,120
the endless plotting...

54
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:39,400
Everyone looks out
for their own interests.

55
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,000
But you're different.

56
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,360
You'd rather anger me,

57
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:44,680
defy the Empress Dowager,

58
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,360
and be sent to the cold palace

59
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:50,040
than stop fighting for Xihe and Jinxuan.

60
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:51,880
You do the right thing unnoticed,

61
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,280
and stay true to yourself.

62
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:55,240
Wealth cannot corrupt you,

63
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,960
nor power bend you.

64
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:57,960
I've never seen a woman

65
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,440
so upright,

66
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,400
and so unyielding.

67
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,400
I once thought

68
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,320
you fought Concubine Qi and the rest

69
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,240
only for personal revenge.

70
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,200
But now I see

71
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:12,240
I was narrow-minded.

72
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,880
You're too kind, Your Majesty.

73
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,800
I've simply

74
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,840
seen too much injustice in the world.

75
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:24,480
After entering the palace,

76
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,840
I saw how hard women
struggle to survive.

77
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:30,080
I only did what I believed was right.

78
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,280
If I see injustice and stay silent,

79
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,480
or see suffering and refuse to help,

80
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:37,520
wouldn't I become

81
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,440
just like those selfish people?

82
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,120
I've been a victim.

83
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:43,960
I'll never become an oppressor.

84
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:45,760
That is precisely why

85
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:49,440
I will entrust the harem to you.

86
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:55,680
Yes, Your Majesty.

87
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:05,160
By the Mandate of Heaven,

88
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,760
the Emperor hereby decrees:

89
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,640
Imperial Consort Fu Rong

90
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:10,280
is gentle and virtuous in nature,

91
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,880
well-versed in the ways
of the inner palace,

92
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,520
and distinguished
by her exemplary conduct

93
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:16,560
Today, I proclaim to the realm that

94
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:19,640
Fu Rong shall be the Empress,

95
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,520
entrusted with the inner palace,

96
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:23,280
and serve as a role model to all women.

97
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,400
From this day forward,

98
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:27,240
Empress Fu Rong
shall take charge of the harem

99
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,960
and oversee all matters
of the inner palace.

100
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,720
So decreed.

101
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:38,520
Your Majesty.

102
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,600
This...

103
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:44,880
I've decided to abolish the old system.

104
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,560
From now on, no more marriage alliances.

105
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,720
That day, you told me

106
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,240
men should guard the realm
with iron and blood,

107
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:55,280
not trade away women to buy peace.

108
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,640
From that moment,

109
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:59,320
I resolved to lead the army myself.

110
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:00,840
This time,

111
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,840
I won't return until Beijie is defeated.

112
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,680
I'll defeat our enemies myself

113
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,360
and secure my nation.

114
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,480
So our children

115
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,000
and generations to come

116
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,520
will never have

117
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,680
to trade marriage for peace again.

118
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,080
I will place

119
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,040
the peace of generations to come

120
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:19,800
in my Empress's hands myself.

121
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:24,920
Accept the decree.

122
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,560
I...

123
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:47,440
accept the decree with gratitude.

124
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:24,960
Your Highness,

125
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:25,880
terrible news!

126
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:26,920
What's all the fuss?

127
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,600
I just heard from
the Imperial Household.

128
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,960
His Majesty went to the cold palace

129
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,760
to name Fu Rong Empress.

130
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:34,240
What did you say?

131
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,440
It's absolutely true.

132
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,240
The Imperial Household is

133
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:39,880
already preparing for the investiture.

134
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,880
The Imperial Wardrobe is
rushing her Empress robes.

135
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,320
The whole palace knows.

136
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,800
No...

137
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,240
Impossible.

138
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,360
His Majesty threw her
into the cold palace.

139
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,400
How could he make her Empress?

140
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,600
And...

141
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,240
Your Highness,

142
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,600
I also heard

143
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,720
His Majesty raged at morning court

144
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,960
and punished many ministers.

145
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:00,640
He's leading the army
against Beijie himself.

146
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,080
Princess Jinxuan

147
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:03,760
no longer has to marry.

148
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,480
No.

149
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,320
It can't be.

150
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,040
How could this happen?

151
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,480
That wretch Fu Rong!

152
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,920
How could she crawl out of
the cold palace again?

153
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,440
My father

154
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,840
died saving His Majesty's life.

155
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,360
I've served him for over ten years.

156
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,000
Who is Fu Rong to him?

157
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:26,480
A disgraced woman thrown into
the cold palace for defying him.

158
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,520
A lowborn wretch!

159
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,680
Why should she be Empress?

160
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:31,960
Why?

161
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:45,120
Your Highness.

162
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:45,760
Your Highness.

163
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:46,360
Your Highness.

164
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,000
Your Highness.

165
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,200
His Majesty is busy with state affairs.

166
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,240
He sees no one.

167
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:49,800
Out of my way.

168
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,120
I must see His Majesty!

169
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:52,600
Your Highness,

170
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:53,760
please go back.

171
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:56,080
How dare a mere guard dog stop me?

172
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,600
Once I see His Majesty,

173
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:58,840
I'll have you punished first.

174
00:07:59,040 --> 00:07:59,480
Move!

175
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,920
Please don't make this hard for me.

176
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,680
His Majesty is handling
military affairs.

177
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,440
He has no time for you.

178
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:17,600
Go back.

179
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:18,480
Impossible.

180
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,600
He won't treat me this way.

181
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:21,760
It's you.

182
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,120
It must be you!

183
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,160
You poisoned His Majesty's mind
against me.

184
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:27,000
That's why he let you out of
the cold palace

185
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,160
and made you Empress.

186
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,080
He wouldn't do this to me.

187
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,240
My father saved his life.

188
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:35,720
He won't forget that.

189
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,240
His Majesty

190
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,760
would never truly blame me.

191
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,200
No matter what,

192
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,920
he would never punish me.

193
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:42,920
He wouldn't.

194
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,160
I must see him.

195
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,400
Your Majesty.

196
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:47,520
Please see me!

197
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:48,120
Your Majesty!

198
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,440
- Your Majesty!
- Eunuch Liu.

199
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,040
His Majesty asked me

200
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,320
to pass along a message.

201
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:56,400
Want to hear it?

202
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,520
Why won't he tell me himself?

203
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,360
Who are you to speak for him?

204
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,960
What makes you think you can?

205
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,960
His Majesty knew you'd come today,

206
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,800
so he asked me to tell you.

207
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,160
He has always been

208
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:08,880
grateful for

209
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:11,680
General Lin saving his life
in his hour of need.

210
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,640
That's why he always protected you.

211
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,560
Even when you did wrong,

212
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,320
he never gave you

213
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,800
any severe punishment.

214
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,760
Back then, His Majesty was still heir.

215
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:24,960
Rebels stormed the palace.

216
00:09:25,440 --> 00:09:26,360
My father

217
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,320
risked his life to protect him.

218
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,440
In the end,

219
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,440
the rebels brutally killed him.

220
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:33,760
They hung his head

221
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,680
on the city gate.

222
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,280
My entire family

223
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,480
was wiped out.

224
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,400
Only I survived

225
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,640
because I was at a temple
outside the city

226
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,560
to pray that day.

227
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,520
True.

228
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,800
So after he ascended the throne,

229
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,040
he brought you

230
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,440
into the palace and gave you shelter.

231
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,280
He never forgot

232
00:09:58,280 --> 00:09:59,800
your father's dying wish,

233
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:01,640
which is to keep you

234
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,080
safe for life.

235
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,680
Keep me safe for life?

236
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:08,160
My family served the empire
for generations.

237
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,880
My father died saving His Majesty.

238
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,240
And I?

239
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,480
I could only be a maid
beside the Empress.

240
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,480
My childhood friend, beneath my station,

241
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:19,480
became my mistress.

242
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:23,520
You think the late Empress
made you a maid

243
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:24,800
out of pity?

244
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,520
She was protecting you.

245
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:28,720
Protecting me?

246
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:30,400
Nonsense!

247
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,600
She became Empress,

248
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:36,280
while I was treated like a stray dog,
begging for scraps.

249
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,720
She had His Majesty's favor,

250
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:41,400
yet she still came to flaunt it
in my face!

251
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:44,040
So you think her kindness

252
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,120
was flaunting?

253
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,080
What else?

254
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,320
Just because my father died,

255
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:51,120
my family was wiped out,

256
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,920
and I lost my backing.

257
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,560
If my father were still alive,

258
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,360
as a hero of the realm,

259
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,760
and given my childhood bond
with His Majesty,

260
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,320
I would be Empress.

261
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:04,320
I'd be the one standing by his side!

262
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:06,720
The late Empress treated you
like her own sister,

263
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:09,480
yet you were so petty and narrow-minded.

264
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:12,040
I truly feel it was unfair to her.

265
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:13,880
Sister?

266
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,840
Who was her sister?

267
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:17,720
If she truly saw me as one,

268
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:19,560
she should've given me His Majesty.

269
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,920
If she truly understood my feelings,

270
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,880
she should've given me
her place as Empress.

271
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:25,920
No one helped me,

272
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,840
so I took it myself

273
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,560
and swapped her medicine.

274
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:33,280
Only if she died,

275
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,800
could I have His Majesty to myself.

276
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,360
You're truly

277
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:40,000
out of your mind.

278
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,720
Your father's dying wish
was to keep you safe.

279
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:46,000
The late Empress made you a maid

280
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:47,920
so that when you turned twenty,

281
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:49,200
she could send you out of the palace

282
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,120
and find you a good match.

283
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,040
Did you know that?

284
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,320
A good match?

285
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,720
All my life,

286
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,640
I've loved only His Majesty.

287
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,880
I'm the only woman worthy of him.

288
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,480
Only I could bear his children.

289
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,000
If she hadn't taken my place,

290
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:08,120
I would've won his heart long ago!

291
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,720
You're beyond saving.

292
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:12,960
You think your schemes were flawless,

293
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,160
and no one noticed?

294
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:16,560
(Imperial Study)
Someone was covering for you.

295
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,240
Did you know

296
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:21,000
the late Empress knew you tampered

297
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:22,400
with her medicine?

298
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,240
What did you say?

299
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,590
(Imperial Study)

300
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,200
Before the late Empress died,

301
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,080
she told the physician at the time,

302
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,640
Director Li,

303
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:37,800
never to reveal

304
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,200
you swapped her medicine.

305
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,080
She asked him

306
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,120
to keep the secret for life.

307
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:45,000
The late Empress said

308
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,600
you'd suffered so much in life.

309
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,240
A mother lost young,

310
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,600
a father killed cruelly,

311
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,720
and a family wiped out.

312
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,520
She couldn't let you suffer more.

313
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:59,520
You were sisters all your lives,

314
00:12:59,880 --> 00:13:01,520
so she'd rather sacrifice herself

315
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:02,680
just to keep you safe.

316
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,480
What more could you want from her?

317
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:08,160
Your father died in a palace coup.

318
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,600
He knew how dangerous the palace was.

319
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:11,240
His Majesty indulged you

320
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:12,520
and protected you,

321
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:14,080
waiting for you to come of age

322
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,560
so you could leave this abyss behind.

323
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,120
But what did you do?

324
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:18,600
You killed

325
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:21,120
the late Empress,
who loved you like a sister.

326
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:24,040
You killed innocent consorts
and children.

327
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:28,600
You betrayed the
late Empress's kindness,

328
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,480
and you let down

329
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,640
your father

330
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,360
(Imperial Study)
and His Majesty.

331
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:42,460
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

332
00:13:42,900 --> 00:13:47,500
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

333
00:13:47,700 --> 00:13:52,300
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

334
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:57,140
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

335
00:13:57,420 --> 00:14:01,900
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

336
00:14:02,340 --> 00:14:06,940
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

337
00:14:07,140 --> 00:14:11,740
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

338
00:14:12,100 --> 00:14:16,700
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

339
00:14:16,860 --> 00:14:21,460
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

340
00:14:21,740 --> 00:14:25,020
♪Let the stars and sea♪

341
00:14:25,020 --> 00:14:26,340
(Changsheng Gate)

342
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:30,220
♪Wait for your return♪
